  <data name="InQuartersTurnoutHelp" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Time a unit at its station needs before it is moving. Applies to units in an In Quarters status and to units with no GPS position (taken to be at their station). Added to the travel time when ranking closest units. 0 = none.</value>
